        <p class="bm-portfolio-single-5__content-accent-heading">Brand Design</p>
        <p class="bm-portfolio-single-5__content-text">We executed on-page SEO, created a content marketing calendar with educational blog posts, and addressed technical SEO issues like site speed.</p>
